  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU action for Sound Public Financial Management and Private Sector Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective (Impact) of this action is to improve financial and economic governance for an inclusive, greener and digitalised Ghanaian society and economy.&amp;nbsp;SO1: Public Finance Management in Ghana is improved, more transparent and accountable, including social demand-side accountability through CSOs engagement with gender and green responsive budgeting in place.&amp;nbsp;SO2: Private sector in Ghana is greener, digitalised and more inclusive (including in the creative and heritage, healthcare and pharmaceutical industries).</narrative>
  </description>
